    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d349">

                <pb facs="0619" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg519"/>

                <head>No. 349.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Sir Edward
                            Thornton to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-06-28"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 28,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to your note of the 8th
                    instant I have the honor to transmit herewith copy of a report of the privy
                    council of Canada, <pb facs="0620" n="520" xml:id="pg520"/> which has been
                    forwarded to me by the governor-general of Canada, relating to the desire of
                    several Canadians to purchase cattle in Kentucky for breeding purposes, if they
                    can be allowed to be taken into Canada.</p>
                <p>I shall also forward copy of the inclosed report of Her Majesty’s Government.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>ED W’D THORNTON.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d349-a1.xml" xpointer="d349-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
